THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CLAUDE.md 5.12 and Article 9 ("To add a dependency") require that a dependency is
listed here, with its exact pinned version and the licence text that was actually
read, before it may be linked. The CycloneDX SBOM is regenerated in the same
change (piricad.md §9.11 — SBOM production is a GPL-compliance obligation, not a
nice-to-have).

Currently linked
----------------

  Qt 6                    LGPLv3 / GPLv2+       6.10.2
                          Used under LGPLv3. Qt is dynamically linked; the
                          relinking right is preserved. Qt Charts and
                          Qt DataVisualization are GPLv3-only and are NOT used.

Bundled in-tree
---------------

  (none)

Approved but not yet enabled
----------------------------

Each of these is gated behind a PIRICAD_WITH_<NAME> CMake option that defaults to
OFF (CLAUDE.md Article 8.2). The licence column records the compatibility finding;
the exact version is pinned in vcpkg.json when the option is first enabled.

  GDAL/OGR                MIT                   format I/O
  PROJ                    MIT                   coordinate transformation
  GEOS                    LGPL 2.1              overlay operations
  CGAL                    GPLv3+                exact arithmetic, straight skeleton
  Clipper2                BSL-1.0               polygon boolean and offset
  CDT                     MPL 2.0               constrained Delaunay
  Boost (Geometry, PFR)   BSL-1.0               R-tree index
  Eigen                   MPL 2.0               linear algebra, adjustment
  Shewchuk predicates     public domain         robust orientation / incircle
  Lua + sol2              MIT                   hot-path script layer
  CPython + pybind11      PSF / BSD-3           optional ecosystem module
  llama.cpp               MIT                   local LLM inference
  ONNX Runtime            MIT                   embedding models
  sqlite-vec              Apache 2.0            vector search for the mevzuat RAG
  libdxfrw                GPLv2+                DXF
  LibreDWG                GPLv3+                DWG read
  Qt Advanced Docking     LGPLv2.1              CAD-grade docking
  doctest                 MIT                   test framework
  Tracy                   BSD-3                 frame profiling
  Crashpad                Apache 2.0            crash reporting

Refused
-------

  Triangle (Shewchuk triangulator)   Commercial use restricted; GPL-incompatible.
                                     Use CDT or CGAL. Shewchuk's predicates.c is a
                                     separate, freely usable file and IS required.

  ODA Drawings SDK                   Closed source; GPL-incompatible. DWG support
                                     is bounded by LibreDWG quality, and that is
                                     recorded as the project's largest technical
                                     risk (piricad.md §9.8, §15).

  Any GPLv2-only dependency          Incompatible with the Apache-2.0 components
                                     this project depends on (piricad.md §1).
